            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Prerequisites</h3>In this text we learn how the Quipu represents numbers. Before starting, we recommend reading:</p><p><ul><li><b>Change of direction (Part I)</b>: presents the Indigenous idea of growing numbers upward, the same idea that the Quipu uses for its orders (<htcite0> ; <htcite1> ; <htcite2>).</li><li><b>Change of direction (Part II)</b>: shows how large numbers are built order by order in the Yupana and in the Mesoamerican system (<htcite3>).</li></ul></p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "e92e3d06-886e-4d3c-811f-bcbcce9aa832",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Change of direction (Part I)",
