      {
         "id": "SECTION_game",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Represent numbers with the Quipu</h3>It is your turn. Choose a level and add knots with the arrows. Build the number from the units upward: when an order is complete, the game jumps immediately to the next order on the string. Remember that the absence of a knot means zero.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><button type=\"button\" class=\"quipuLevelBtn\" data-quipu-level=\"0\">Level 1: 1 to 9</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"quipuLevelBtn\" data-quipu-level=\"1\">Level 2: 10 to 99</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"quipuLevelBtn\" data-quipu-level=\"2\">Level 3: 100 to 999</button> <button type=\"button\" id=\"quipuNewBtn\" class=\"quipuNewBtn\">New number</button></p><div id=\"quipuBoard\" class=\"quipuBoard\"></div><p id=\"quipuMessage\" class=\"quipuMessage\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><p id=\"quipuCongrats\" class=\"quipuCongrats\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\" style=\"color: gold;\"></i> <span id=\"quipuCongratsText\"></span></p><span id=\"quipuOrder0\" style=\"display: none;\">Units</span><span id=\"quipuOrder1\" style=\"display: none;\">Tens</span><span id=\"quipuOrder2\" style=\"display: none;\">Hundreds</span><span id=\"quipuMsgOrder\" style=\"display: none;\">Order complete! The game jumps to the next order.</span><span id=\"quipuMsgString\" style=\"display: none;\">Number complete! Now continue with the next string.</span><span id=\"quipuMsgLevel\" style=\"display: none;\">Level complete! Press New number to play again.</span>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\">The rules for representing numbers with knots follow the description of Marcia Ascher and Robert Ascher (<htcite0>), and the vertical order studied in <i>Change of direction (Part II)</i> (<htcite1>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "4f8542c9-f060-4d3c-8a67-971b6d63e1ff",
                     "text": "Ascher, M., & Ascher, R.",
                     "page": "pp. 29 - 32",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2013",
                        "month": "",
